<title>AUSTRIA: ALPINE SKIING-WIBERG WINS WORLD CUP SLALOM.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-WIBERG WINS WORLD CUP SLALOM.</headline>
<dateline>SEMMERING, Austria 1996-12-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pernilla Wiberg of Sweden won an Alpine skiing women's World Cup slalom on Saturday with a combined time of one minute 42.76 seconds.  </p>
<p>Italy's Deborah Compagnoni was second with a combined time of 1:43.88 and Anita Wachter of Austria was third in 1:43.94.</p>
